# Better Auth

## MVP auth

Email/password and sessions only. No social login, orgs, or RBAC in v1.

## TanStack Start integration

Use `tanstackStartCookies()` plugin — already configured in `src/lib/auth.ts`:

```tsx
import { betterAuth } from 'better-auth'
import { tanstackStartCookies } from 'better-auth/tanstack-start'

export const auth = betterAuth({
  emailAndPassword: { enabled: true },
  plugins: [tanstackStartCookies()],
})
```

Auth API route: `src/routes/api/auth/$.ts`.

## Secrets

`BETTER_AUTH_SECRET` in `.env.local`. Generate with:

```bash
npx -y @better-auth/cli secret
```

## Wrangler

Keep `nodejs_compat` enabled in `wrangler.jsonc`.

Protect personal actions (save resource, library) with session validation on the server.
